'''Lord Jawbus''' is a {{Rarity|m|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from lava on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Lord Jawbus''' can be fished up from any Lava source on the [[Crimson Isle]]. They require {{skl|fishing|45}} or higher to be fished up, as well as [[Odger#Rewards|Adept Trophy Fisher]].

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Lord Jawbus''' is {{Green|8}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|0.17%|1|581|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
