== Behavior ==
Once spawned, '''Lord Jawbus''' walks around shooting fireballs for {{Stat|Damage|2,500}} and a laser for {{Stat|Damage|30,000}} at nearby players.

After it drops to {{Stat|health|60m, 40m or 20m}}, '''Lord Jawbus''' will float upwards from its current position, spawning 2 '''Jawbus Followers''' which are any non-[[Hotspot]] [[Sea Creatures]] fished on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} except for {{MobSprite|Plhlegblast}}, {{MobSprite|Thunder}}, or '''Lord Jawbus''' itself. Then, '''Lord Jawbus''' will fire TNT upwards and towards players which explode when hitting the ground. Once the '''Jawbus Followers''' are killed, the fire sphere around '''Lord Jawbus''' will dissipate and it will return to attacking players.

