== Tips ==
* If a player plans to draw '''Lord Jawbus'''{{'}} aggro or does not want to die for [[Loot Sharing|loot share]], {{Item|Bronze Hunter Armor}}, {{Item|Silver Hunter Armor}}, {{Item|Gold Hunter Armor}} or {{Item|Diamond Hunter Armor}} can make them immune to damage.
**This also makes '''Lord Jawbus''' immune to the player's damage.

== Trivia ==
* Despite the message when '''Lord Jawbus''' is fished up, they are {{Mythic}} and not {{Legendary}}.
* Killing '''Lord Jawbus''' without any assistance unlocks the "Jawbus Destroyer" task in {{Item|Pandora's Box}}.

